msgstr "Start Import"

#: wechat-article-importer.php:362
msgid ""
"Paste a WeChat Official Account article link to fetch the title, content, "
"cover image, and inline images automatically, then save the result as a "
"WordPress draft."
msgstr ""
"Paste a WeChat Official Account article link to fetch the title, content, "
"cover image, and inline images automatically, then save the result as a "
"WordPress draft."

#: wechat-article-importer.php:363
msgid ""
"Imported content is converted into WordPress-stable HTML: layout styles are "
"preserved, fonts, body text sizes and line spacing are left to the site "
"theme, and WeChat editor markers, empty attributes, and unstable placeholder "
"elements are removed."
msgstr ""
"Imported content is converted into WordPress-stable HTML: layout styles are "
"preserved, fonts, body text sizes and line spacing are left to the site "
"theme, and WeChat editor markers, empty attributes, and unstable placeholder "
"elements are removed."

#: wechat-article-importer.php:369
msgid "Article URL"
msgstr "Article URL"

#: wechat-article-importer.php:370
msgid "Paste the full https://mp.weixin.qq.com/... link"
msgstr "Paste the full https://mp.weixin.qq.com/... link"

#: wechat-article-importer.php:373
msgid "Import options"
msgstr "Import options"

#: wechat-article-importer.php:378
msgid "Generate thumbnails for imported images"
msgstr "Generate thumbnails for imported images"

#: wechat-article-importer.php:380
msgid ""
"Recommended. Disable this only if your server is slow or fails while "
"importing articles with very large images."
msgstr ""
"Recommended. Disable this only if your server is slow or fails while "
"importing articles with very large images."

#: wechat-article-importer.php:398 wechat-article-importer.php:448
